        {
            "block_label": "text",
            "block_content": "(a) For each day worked on a Local Assignment, an Employee shall (except when Paragraph 3(b) applies) receive the applicable Daily Transportation Expense and Daily Miscellaneous Allowances as provided in the schedule immediately below.",
