        {
            "block_label": "text",
            "block_content": "(b) Notwithstanding the provisions of Paragraph 4(c) below or any other references to Per Diem throughout this Contract, an Employee notified of a Local Assignment of 50 up to 65 road miles may, in lieu of the Local Assignment Daily Transportation Expense and Daily Miscellaneous Allowances, elect that lodging be provided by the Company. In such cases, the Employee will receive:",
            "block_bbox": [
                343,
