            "block_content": "when the Local Assignment extends across a weekend(s) but is terminated on Friday, in lieu of the one (1) minute per mile and the $0.36 per mile, the Employee will receive the applicable Daily Transportation Expense and Daily Miscellaneous Allowance as provided in the schedule immediately below for the round-trip to his/her Base on Friday and back to the Job Location on Monday, and",
